  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Thinly slice cucumber into half-moons.<br>• Thinly slice red radish.<br>• Slice avocado in half, scoop out flesh and roughly chop.</p> <p>• In a medium bowl, place haloumi and cover with water to soak.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185bf5917498f8bf2daf9/step-c75c9200.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Drain haloumi and pat dry. Cut the haloumi into 1cm-thick slices.</p> <p>• In a large frying pan, heat a drizzle of olive oil over medium-high heat.</p> <p>• Cook haloumi until golden brown, 1-2 minutes each side. Transfer to a plate to rest.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185bf5917498f8bf2daf9/step-7ef28510.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Meanwhile, in a large bowl, combine cucumber, radish, avocado, deluxe <br>salad mix and a drizzle of olive oil and vinegar. Season with salt and <br>pepper to taste.<br>• Microwave mini flourtortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second <br>bursts until warmed through. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185bf5917498f8bf2daf9/step-a835e020.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Spread tortilla bases with some of the plant-based smokey aioli.</p> <p>• Fill each tortilla with cucumber salad and haloumi.</p> <p>• Drizzle tacos with remaining plant-based smokey aioli to serve. Enjoy!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/681185bf5917498f8bf2daf9/step-3ad35330.jpg"
    }
  ]
